cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TRIVAX in academic work, please cite this software release."
title: "TRIVAX: Resolutive Adaptive Edge Control Runtime"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Matos"
    given-names: "Marcelo Roldão"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-14"
repository-code: "https://github.com/marceloroldao/trivax"
license: "LicenseRef-TRIVAX-Research-Commercial-1.0"
keywords:
  - adaptive control
  - edge control
  - temporal credit
  - delayed feedback
  - embedded systems
  - IoT
  - robotics
abstract: >-
  TRIVAX is an experimental framework for compact adaptive edge control,
  temporal credit assignment, delayed-feedback control, and inspectable
  decision making on constrained hardware. Version 0.1 is an experimental
  research release and does not claim general superiority over established
  control methods.
